# Monorepo

- Open repo root as workspace. Backend in `backend/`, frontend in `frontend/`, tests in `tests/`.
- Use `python3` or `.venv/bin/python`, not bare `python`.
- Run tests from root: `python3 -m pytest tests/`
- Frontend `/api/*` proxies to FastAPI on `:8000`. Keep `frontend/lib/types.ts` aligned with `backend/models.py`.
